    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2HoHsH3DJSWqEA4Xi5X1CoH)_\n\n## What\n`org-other-agenda` (yibie's board, installed by `sp-org-agenda`) showed links in row titles unfolded as `[[id:...][title]]`. Rows now show only the description in `org-link` face.\n\n## How\n- The link rendering of the query tables (vui/exc cells) moved from `sp-collection-query-tables-core` to `sp-org-id-link` as `sp-org-link-linkify`, `-has-link-p`, `-open`, `-map` (renamed from `sp-collec-query-*`, no aliases). The query tables now call these.\n- `sp-org-agenda` adds `:filter-return` advice on the package's private `org-other-agenda--clean-title` that calls `sp-org-link-linkify`. If the package renames that function, links show unfolded again.\n- Docs (`sp-org-id-link`, `sp-org-agenda`, `sp-collection-query-tables`) and CHANGELOG updated.\n\n## Not tested\nNo Emacs in the container, so nothing was byte-compiled or run. Please check that an agenda row with an `[[id:..][..]]` heading shows the description.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBYr3z2DmJbRgitAA9)_",
